<title>POLAND: Polish shares end lower in Warsaw continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end lower in Warsaw continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budimex and Universal fell, Debica rose, Elektrim and Stalexport were flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday.</p>
<p>Total turnover rose to 1.1 million zlotys from Thursday's one million.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell in 13.4 million zloty trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
